    "reason": "The only evidence is a one-line Enhancements entry [ev-bfb9c0ed4d28]. It says the http-wasm host was upgraded to v0.6.0 so that it supports clients using v0.4.0. It does not say what happens to existing wasm plugins built against older http-wasm guest versions: whether they keep working unchanged, behave differently or break. So neither behavior-change nor none is established. The proposed statement's \"maintain compatibility\" also goes beyond the text. Deciding this needs PR #10475 details or upgrade-guide text on http-wasm plugin compatibility, and none is shown in the section context.",
